screensaver4wayland (1.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release of the GNOME Wayland image screensaver.
  * Support independent monitor images, slideshows, scaling and native settings.
  * Include WebP decoding, a monitor SVG icon and desktop identity integration.
  * Add architecture-independent Debian package and reproducible source archives.

